Subject: [05] Reuse the canonical prelude directory and stop at the first eligible source when discovering libraries, NASALib `orders/top`

Measurement: 41.07 → 32.63 s. 3.75 → 3.34 GB. On `ints/gcd`, allocation fell 5.8% while isolated median time rose from 3.20 to 3.34 s.

